  Description: Prerequisite Region - Shining Kingdoms You were trained to be an ambassador
    of the elven land of Kyonin, and you have now been sent out into the wider world
    to build alliances between Kyonin and the neighboring kingdoms. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Charisma or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute
    boost. You're trained in the Society skill and the Politics Lore skill. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Multilingual] skill feat.
